":"and the earth","tr":"wal-arḍa","l":"أَرْض","r":"أرض","p":"particule","a":"wbw/064_003_003.mp3"},{"t":"بِٱلْحَقِّ","en":"with truth","tr":"bil-ḥaqi","l":"حَقّ","r":"حقق","p":"nom","a":"wbw/064_003_004.mp3"},{"t":"وَصَوَّرَكُمْ","en":"and He formed you","tr":"waṣawwarakum","l":"صَوَّرَ","r":"صور","p":"verbe","a":"wbw/064_003_005.mp3"},{"t":"فَأَحْسَنَ","en":"and made good","tr":"fa-aḥsana","l":"أَحْسَنَ","r":"حسن","p":"verbe","a":"wbw/064_003_006.mp3"},{"t":"صُوَرَكُمْ ۖ","en":"your forms","tr":"ṣuwarakum","l":"صُورَة","r":"صور","p":"particule","a":"wbw/064_003_007.mp3"},{"t":"وَإِلَيْهِ","en":"and to Him","tr":"wa-ilayhi","l":"إِلَى","r":null,"p":"préposition","a":"wbw/064_003_009.mp3"},{"t":"ٱلْمَصِيرُ","en":"(is) the final return","tr":"l-maṣīru","l":"مَصِير","r":"صير","p":"nom","a":"wbw/064_003_010.mp3"}]},{"n":4,"k":"64:4","fr":"Il sait ce qui est dans les cieux et la Terre, et il sait ce que vous cachez ainsi que ce que vous divulguez. Et Allah connaît bien le contenu des poitrines.","audio":"Alafasy/mp3/064004.mp3","w":[{"t":"يَعْلَمُ","en":"He knows","tr":"yaʿlamu","l":"عَلِمَ","r":"علم","p":"verbe","a":"wbw/064_004_001.mp3"},{"t":"مَا","en":"what","tr":"mā","l":"ما","r":null,"p":"relatif","a":"wbw/064_004_002.mp3"},{"t":"فِى","en":"(is) in","tr":"fī","l":"فِي","r":null,"p":"préposition","a":"wbw/064_004_003.mp3"},{"t":"ٱلسَّمَـٰوَٰتِ","en":"the heavens","tr":"l-samāwāti","l":"سَماء","r":"سمو","p":"nom","a":"wbw/064_004_004.mp3"},{"t":"وَٱلْأَرْضِ","en":"and the earth","tr":"wal-arḍi","l":"أَرْض","r":"أرض","p":"nom","a":"wbw/064_004_005.mp3"},{"t":"وَيَعْلَمُ","en":"and He knows","tr":"wayaʿlamu","l":"عَلِمَ","r":"علم","p":"verbe","a":"wbw/064_004_006.mp3"},{"t":"مَا","en":"what","tr":"mā","l":"ما","r":null,"p":"relatif","a":"wbw/064_004_007.mp3"},{"t":"تُسِرُّونَ","en":"you conceal","tr":"tusirrūna","l":"أَسَرَّ","r":"سرر","p":"verbe","a":"wbw/064_004_008.mp3"},{"t":"وَمَا","en":"and what","tr":"wamā","l":"ما","r":null,"p":"relatif","a":"wbw/064_004_009.mp3"},{"t":"تُعْلِنُونَ ۚ","en":"you declare","tr":"tuʿ'linūna","l":"أَعْلَن","r":"علن","p":"verbe","a":"wbw/064_004_010.mp3"},{"t":"وَٱللَّهُ","en":"And Allah","tr":"wal-lahu","l":"اللَّه","r":"أله","p":"nom propre","a":"wbw/064_004_012.mp3"},{"t":"عَلِيمٌۢ","en":"(is) All-Knowing","tr":"ʿalīmun","l":"عَلِيم","r":"علم","p":"nom","a":"wbw/064_004_013.mp3"},{"t":"بِذَاتِ","en":"of what","tr":"bidhāti","l":"ذُو","r":null,"p":"nom","a":"wbw/064_004_014.mp3"},{"t":"ٱلصُّدُورِ","en":"(is in) the breasts","tr":"l-ṣudūri","l":"صَدْر","r":"صدر","p":"nom","a":"wbw/064_004_015.mp3"}]},{"n":5,"k":"64:5","fr":"Ne vous est-elle pas parvenue, la nouvelle de ceux qui auparavant ont mécru et qui ont goûté la conséquence néfaste de leur acte ; ils auront en outre un châtiment douloureux.","audio":"Alafasy/mp3/064005.mp3","w":[{"t":"أَلَمْ","en":"Has not","tr":"alam","l":"لَم","r":null,"p":"négation","a":"wbw/064_005_001.mp3"},{"t":"يَأْتِكُمْ","en":"come to you","tr":"yatikum","l":"أَتَى","r":"أتي","p":"verbe","a":"wbw/064_005_002.mp3"},{"t":"نَبَؤُا۟","en":"(the) news","tr":"naba-u","l":"نَبَأ","r":"نبأ","p":"nom","a":"wbw/064_005_003.mp3"},{"t":"ٱلَّذِينَ","en":"(of) those who","tr":"alladhīna","l":"الَّذِي","r":null,"p":"relatif","a":"wbw/064_005_004.mp3"},{"t":"كَفَرُوا۟","en":"disbelieved","tr":"kafarū","l":"كَفَرَ","r":"كفر","p":"verbe","a":"wbw/064_005_005.mp3"},{"t":"مِن","en":"from","tr":"min","l":"مِن","r":null,"p":"préposition","a":"wbw/064_005_006.mp3"},{"t":"قَبْلُ","en":"before","tr":"qablu","l":"قَبْل","r":"قبل","p":"nom","a":"wbw/064_005_007.mp3"},{"t":"فَذَاقُوا۟","en":"So they tasted","tr":"fadhāqū","l":"ذاقُ","r":"ذوق","p":"verbe","a":"wbw/064_005_008.mp3"},{"t":"وَبَالَ","en":"(the bad) consequence","tr":"wabāla","l":"وَبال","r":"وبل","p":"particule","a":"wbw/064_005_009.mp3"},{"t":"أَمْرِهِمْ","en":"(of) their affair","tr":"amrihim","l":"أَمْر","r":"أمر","p":"nom","a":"wbw/064_005_010.mp3"},{"t":"وَلَهُمْ","en":"and for them","tr":"walahum","l":"وَلَهُمْ","r":null,"p":"pronom","a":"wbw/064_005_011.mp3"},{"t":"عَذَابٌ","en":"(is) a punishment","tr":"ʿadhābun","l":"عَذاب","r":"عذب","p":"nom","a":"wbw/064_005_012.mp3"},{"t":"أَلِيمٌۭ","en":"painful","tr":"alīmun","l":"أَلِيم","r":"ألم","p":"adjectif","a":"wbw/064_005_013.mp3"}]},{"n":6,"k":"64:6","fr":"Il en est ainsi parce que leurs messagers leur venaient avec des preuves évidentes, et qu’ils ont dit : \"Sont-ce des hommes qui nous guideront ?\" Ils mécrurent alors et se détournèrent et Allah Se passa [d’eux] et Allah Se suffit à Lui-même et Il est Digne de louange.","audio":"Alafasy/mp3/064006.mp3","w":[{"t":"ذَٰلِكَ","en":"That","tr":"dhālika","l":"ذا","r":null,"p":"démonstratif","a":"wbw/064_006_001.mp3"},{"t":"بِأَنَّهُۥ","en":"(is) because","tr":"bi-annahu","l":"أَنّ","r":null,"p":"particule","a":"wbw/064_006_002.mp3"},{"t":"كَانَت","en":"had","tr":"kānat","l":"كانَ","r":"كون","p":"verbe","a":"wbw/064_006_003.mp3"},{"t":"تَّأْتِيهِمْ","en":"come to them","tr":"tatīhim","l":"أَتَى","r":"أتي","p":"verbe","a":"wbw/064_006_004.mp3"},{"t":"رُسُلُهُم","en":"their Messengers","tr":"rusuluhum","l":"رَسُول","r":"رسل","p":"nom","a":"wbw/064_006_005.mp3"},{"t":"بِٱلْبَيِّنَـٰتِ","en":"with clear proofs","tr":"bil-bayināti","l":"بَيِّنَة","r":"بين","p":"nom","a":"wbw/064_006_006.mp3"},{"t":"فَقَالُوٓا۟","en":"but they said","tr":"faqālū","l":"قالَ","r":"قول","p":"verbe","a":"wbw/064_006_007.mp3"},{"t":"أَبَشَرٌۭ","en":"Shall human beings","tr":"abasharun","l":"بَشَر","r":"بشر","p":"nom","a":"wbw/064_006_008.mp3"},{"t":"يَهْدُونَنَا","en":"guide us","tr":"yahdūnanā","l":"هَدَى","r":"هدي","p":"verbe","a":"wbw/064_006_009.mp3"},{"t":"فَكَفَرُوا۟","en":"So they disbelieved","tr":"fakafarū","l":"كَفَرَ","r":"كفر","p":"verbe","a":"wbw/064_006_010.mp3"},{"t":"وَتَوَلَّوا۟ ۚ","en":"and turned away","tr":"watawallaw","l":"تَوَلَّى","r":"ولي","p":"verbe","a":"wbw/064_006_011.mp3"},{"t":"وَّٱسْتَغْنَى","en":"And can do without them","tr":"wa-is'taghnā","l":"اسْتَغْنَى","r":"غني","p":"verbe","a